        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And the word of the Lord came to Elijah the Tishbite, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 21:28",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "Seest thou how Ahab humbleth himself before me? because he humbleth himself before me, I will not bring the evil in his days: but in his son’s days will I bring the evil upon his house.",
        "footNotes": [],
